    "findings": [
      "Actual intake issues one canonical url/tags funding frame and returns its own genuine durable BOUND result after preflight.",
      "Pinned official HTTP source adds empty description and mimeType fields; local sameResource treats presence as significant.",
      "Pinned upfront HTTP source invokes its six-field enrichment hook without a paymentPayload argument. The binding requires its value to be undefined, not a synthesized payload view.",
      "Actual supported enrichment forms only the SDK-owned unsigned response.resource before the unchanged existing tuple bridge captures it.",
      "Same actual response, accepts array, selected requirement objects, context and transport survive. Original signed headers, payload bytes and requirements are never rewritten.",
      "Existing bridge already admits the larger enrichment context and extra routePattern transport field. No SDK ABI alias, bridge repair, fake native module or test source transform is introduced.",
      "Actual source root hardwires actual intake issuance and bind before actual official verify/first settlement, preserving BOUND and settlement as independent acknowledgement domains.",
      "Root retains a late pending capability, requests its close at most once, joins active work under a cooperative drain budget and never closes borrowed SQL stores.",
      "Root source can create observer SQLite state through the actual intake. Future qualification must count those files and all transitive capabilities explicitly."
    ]
